# Self Study

Learning tool. Notes, books, quizzes, spaced repetition, progress, and points come later. This phase is the shell, local records, and shared UI.

## Rust

- `core` (`study_core`) holds domain types only. No I/O. No dependency on other workspace crates.
- `storage` owns SeaORM entities, migrations, and repository traits. SQLite is the default. Postgres uses the same traits and migrations.
- `ingest` and `ai` stay placeholders.
- `api` is the only crate that depends on the others. Nothing depends on `api` except the desktop shell.
- Do not put desktop-only paths, Tauri types, or app-data directories in `core`, `storage`, or `api`.

## UI

- Static export only. No server-only Next.js APIs.
- `packages/ui/src` is the shared flat component folder. No subfolders. No barrel file.
- `apps/web` and `apps/landing` never import each other. Share a component only by moving it into `packages/ui`.
- `sections/` compose components. `pages/` stay thin.
- Web HTTP goes through `apps/web/src/lib/api-client.ts` only.
- No raw `button`, `input`, `select`, `textarea`, or `table` in a section or page.

## Design system

Before adding or changing a page or component, edit its entry:

- Pages: `design-system/self-study-ai/pages/<page>.md`
- Components: `design-system/self-study-ai/components/<component>.md`
- Marketing overrides: `design-system/self-study-ai/pages/landing.md`

Tokens come from `MASTER.md` through `packages/ui/tailwind.preset.ts`. No raw hex in components. No invented marketing copy.
